	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Claude Rewrite

Rewrite selected text (or the clipboard) with Claude and paste it back.

* **Hotkey (⌃⌥R)**: select text in any app, press the hotkey, pick a style.
* **Keyword `rw`**: works on the clipboard. Type a word to filter styles (`rw prof`), or type an instruction (`rw say yes to thursday`) to get a Custom item plus every style with that instruction added.

Store your API key in the macOS Keychain once:

    security add-generic-password -a "$USER" -s anthropic-api-key -w
</string>
